<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 12:54:22 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>等离激元超材料时间晶体</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/plasmonic-metamaterial-time-crystal</link><description>为了实现所需的超快速变化，他们用强大的激光脉冲撞击超材料。这会剧烈加速材料的自由漂浮电子，动态改变它们的能量，并使它们的“有效质量”在不到万亿分之一秒的时间内移动高达静止质量的 80%。这种巨大而快速的转变迫使材料进入时间晶体状态。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/plasmonic-metamaterial-time-crystal.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 12:54:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/plasmonic-metamaterial-time-crystal</guid></item><item><title>分子系链和异步复制如何驱动寄生虫增殖</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-molecular-tethers-and-asynchronous-replication-drive-parasite-proliferation</link><description>疟原虫以一种不寻常的方式增殖。它们不像人类细胞那样分裂成两个子细胞，而是首先将其遗传物质扩增十倍、百倍甚至数千倍，然后同时产生相应数量的子寄生虫。到目前为止，控制这些过程的机制仅被部分了解。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-molecular-tethers-and-asynchronous-replication-drive-parasite-proliferation2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 12:39:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-molecular-tethers-and-asynchronous-replication-drive-parasite-proliferation</guid></item><item><title>越来越多的证据表明，呼吸污染的空气会增加骨质疏松症的风险</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/breathing-polluted-air-increases-risk-of-osteoporosis-growing-evidence-shows</link><description>研究表明，污染物可以通过多种方式干扰骨骼生长&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/breathing-polluted-air-increases-risk-of-osteoporosis-growing-evidence-shows.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 12:24:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/breathing-polluted-air-increases-risk-of-osteoporosis-growing-evidence-shows</guid></item><item><title>生成式人工智能应如何改变临床决策支持</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-generative-ai-should-transform-clinical-decision-support</link><description>考虑一位初级保健医生对一位 58 岁的患者进行常规随访。电子健康记录 (EHR) 提醒患者有资格接受他汀类药物治疗。医生会忽略它，就像临床医生对绝大多数警报所做的那样。系统验证计算上容易的内容（例如年龄、血脂值和风险评分），但忽略了临床医生的需求：该患者以前是否接受过他汀类药物？他们是否拒绝了？如果是，原因是什么（成本问题、担心不利影响、偏好改变生活方式）？他们之前是否尝试过他汀类药物并经历过肌肉疼痛？如果他们开了他汀类药物，他们是否从药房取过？两个月前，当他们提到在线阅读他汀类药物会导致记忆问题时，他们在患者门户消息中写了什么？答案分散在注释、分发记录和门户消息中。该警报会识别资格，但不会识别患者的决策状态或行动障碍。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-generative-ai-should-transform-clinical-decision-support2.png" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 12:09:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-generative-ai-should-transform-clinical-decision-support</guid></item><item><title>癫痫手术后十年的认知结果：颞叶切除术与选择性杏仁核海马切除术</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ten%e2%80%90year-cognitive-outcomes-following-epilepsy-surgery-temporal-lobectomy-versus-selective-amygdalohippocampectomy</link><description>目的 本研究旨在评估&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/tene28090year-cognitive-outcomes-following-epilepsy-surgery-temporal-lobectomy-versus-selective-amygdalohippocampectomy2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 11:54:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ten%e2%80%90year-cognitive-outcomes-following-epilepsy-surgery-temporal-lobectomy-versus-selective-amygdalohippocampectomy</guid></item><item><title>美国癌症药物的批准</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cancer-medicine-approvals-in-the-us</link><description>我们对 2006 年 1 月 1 日至 2025 年 12 月 31 日期间 FDA 批准用于成人实体瘤的癌症药物进行了横断面研究，包括原始和补充适应症批准。批准摘自 FDA 的肿瘤学（癌症）/血液恶性肿瘤批准通知网站，&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cancer-medicine-approvals-in-the-us.png" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 11:39:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cancer-medicine-approvals-in-the-us</guid></item><item><title>电子离子对撞机电子存储环准直系统基线设计</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/collimation-system-baseline-design-for-the-electron-storage-ring-at-the-electron-ion-collider</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/collimation-system-baseline-design-for-the-electron-storage-ring-at-the-electron-ion-collider2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 11:24:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/collimation-system-baseline-design-for-the-electron-storage-ring-at-the-electron-ion-collider</guid></item><item><title>根据 2026 年血脂异常指南对心血管风险进行重新分类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cardiovascular-risk-reclassification-with-the-2026-dyslipidemia-guideline</link><description>本研究使用国家健康和营养检查调查 (NHANES) 的数据来评估心血管风险重新分类的程度，从 2013 年汇总队列方程 (PCE) 到 2023 年心血管事件预测风险 (PREVENT-ASCVD) 方程。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cardiovascular-risk-reclassification-with-the-2026-dyslipidemia-guideline.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 11:09:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cardiovascular-risk-reclassification-with-the-2026-dyslipidemia-guideline</guid></item><item><title>SGLT2 抑制剂预防 AKI</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/sglt2-inhibitors-for-prevention-of-aki</link><description>这项随机临床试验评估了与安慰剂相比，在择期心脏手术前 1 天开始服用达格列净是否可以降低成年患者术后 7 天急性肾损伤的发生率。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/sglt2-inhibitors-for-prevention-of-aki.png" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 10:54:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/sglt2-inhibitors-for-prevention-of-aki</guid></item><item><title>解码 3D 染色质结构揭示了前列腺癌分层基因调控的不同增强子类别</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/decoding-3d-chromatin-architecture-reveals-distinct-enhancer-classes-underlying-hierarchical-gene-regulation-in-prostate-cancer</link><description>转录过程由非编码调控元件控制，其中 70% 以上是假定的增强子。这些增强子由超过 600,000 个区域组成，并以组蛋白修饰为标志。然而，癌症中改变的增强子在三维染色质结构中合作驱动致癌程序的机制仍然知之甚少。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/decoding-3d-chromatin-architecture-reveals-distinct-enhancer-classes-underlying-hierarchical-gene-regulation-in-prostate-cancer.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 10:39:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/decoding-3d-chromatin-architecture-reveals-distinct-enhancer-classes-underlying-hierarchical-gene-regulation-in-prostate-cancer</guid></item></channel></rss>